      "@type": "Scenario",
      "name": "Minor / SEN Admission — Supported Consent and Accessible Onboarding",
      "description": "A 16-year-old with autism spectrum condition (Mia) applies to join a VTC with her responsible adult (Grace) acting as co-signatory. The ceremony protocol has no concept of co-signed or supported consent; the VTA cannot distinguish supported consent from substituted consent.",
      "lifecyclePhase": "Phase 3–4: Member Admission / Supported Decision-Making",
