      "governance_decisions": "1. Can the VRC architecture represent co-signed consent without conflating it with substituted decision-making?\n2. How is SEN data prevented from being inferred from a co-signatory structure?\n3. What accessible UX adaptations are mandatory for trust task ceremonies?",
